  postHeader: 
  postContent: "This scathing expos\xE9 paints every indigenous healer as charlatans,
    ignoring centuries-old community practices and testimonials from patients who
    swear by herbal cures.\n"
  funFact_Hint: Think about whether every individual in a group really matches one
    label.
  BiasChoices:
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: "More than omitting facts, it actively misrepresents
      by lumping everyone together. \n"
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 5
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: Confirmation bias would cherry-pick supporting
      cases; here it generalizes all cases.
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 3
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 1
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: It dismisses a diverse group with one sweeping
      negative label.
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 7
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: Spin slants facts; this is broad stereotyping.
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 6
